<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
<head>
<title>CSS Test: Tables under the collapsing borders model don't have padding</title>
<style>
div {
  float: left;
  background: green;
}
table {
  border-collapse: collapse;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  width: 100px;
  height: 100px;
  padding: 100px;
}
</style>
</head>
<body><p>Test passes if there is a filled green square.</p>
<div>
  <table></table>
</div>
</body>
</html>
